<title>GREECE: LIVANOS TESTIFIES BEFORE PARLIMENTARY COMTE OVER FLISVOS CASINO.</title>
<headline>LIVANOS TESTIFIES BEFORE PARLIMENTARY COMTE OVER FLISVOS CASINO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Greek Tourist Minister Dionysis Livanos is testifying before the parliamentary committee investigating the award of a licence to build and operate a casino at Flisvos, parliament officials said.</p>
<p>Development Minister Vasso Papandreou revoked the licence to operate and build a new Athens casino at Flisvos last year saying its award was illegal and did not serve the public interest. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
